", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le06ob05re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn7le06ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hey, Sally. How are you?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh, hi, Peter. I'm exhausted. I just came home from work. How are you doing?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh, I'm pretty beat too. I just came back from the gym.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: If I went to the gym, I might feel less stressed.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn7le06ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "21000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Are you eating and sleeping well? It's imperative that you stay healthy if your days are so demanding.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You're right. If I take the time, I can cook nutritious meals. If I went to bed earlier, I would feel more rested the next day. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I find that when I go to the gym even for just 30 minutes, I feel invigorated.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le06ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "41000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I agree. If I eat better, my body has more energy. My boss is always so demanding.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: If I became the boss, I would treat all my employees fairly and not overwork them. Ultimately, people are unhappy if they're overworked. If employees are unhappy, they aren't as productive.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: All I know is, if I won the lottery, I would go back to Africa. Well, I'd better get back at it.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Try not to stay up too late.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le06ob05re2img02.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le06ob05re2img05.jpg"}}], "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "title": ""}]}]}